    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39070" root="ميد" body-key="m">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَيْدَ</span></b>  a dial. form of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَيْدَ</span>, (S,) in the sense of
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَيْر</span>: (S, L;) and in that of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَى</span>: (L:) or that
of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْ أَجْلِ</span>. (S, L.) It is said in a trad., <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنَا</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَفْصَحُ العَرَبِ مَيْدَ أَنِّى مِنْ قُرَيْشٍ وَنَشَأْتُ فِى بَنِى</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَعْدِ بْنِ بَكْرٍ</span> [rendered in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بيد</span>]. (S, L.) See
what next follows.

